    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 FWC to vary certain modern awards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award:\n(a) is made before 1 January 2014; and\n(b) is in operation on that day; and\n(c) immediately before that day, does not include a term (the\nrelevant term) of the kind mentioned in section 149A of the\namended Act.\n(2) The FWC must, by 31 December 2013, make a determination\nvarying the modern award to include the relevant term.\n(3) A determination made under subclause (2) comes into operation on\n(and takes effect from) 1 January 2014.\n(4) Section 168 applies to a determination made under subclause (2) as\nif it were a determination made under Part 2-3.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award:\n(a) is made before 1 January 2014; and\n(b) is in operation on that day; and\n(c) immediately before that day, does not include a term (the\nrelevant term) of the kind mentioned in section 149A of the\namended Act.\n(2) The FWC must, by 31 December 2013, make a determination\nvarying the modern award to include the relevant term.\n(3) A determination made under subclause (2) comes into operation on\n(and takes effect from) 1 January 2014.\n(4) Section 168 applies to a determination made under subclause (2) as\nif it were a determination made under Part 2-3.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-10-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-10-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-10-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6b143217d3314f85ed0e8f11134f0bcd5101a077e88f846283628bbe2bc748f3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 FWC to vary certain modern awards",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award:\n(a) is made before 1 January 2014; and\n(b) is in operation on that day; and\n(c) immediately before that day, does not include a term (the\nrelevant term) of the kind mentioned in section 149A of the\namended Act.\n(2) The FWC must, by 31 December 2013, make a determination\nvarying the modern award to include the relevant term.\n(3) A determination made under subclause (2) comes into operation on\n(and takes effect from) 1 January 2014.\n(4) Section 168 applies to a determination made under subclause (2) as\nif it were a determination made under Part 2-3.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
    },
