    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 FWC to update text of certain modern awards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award:\n(a) is made before 1 January 2014; and\n(b) is in operation on that day; and\n(c) immediately before that day, includes a term (the relevant\nterm) of the kind mentioned in section 155A of the amended\nAct that specifies a fund or scheme (a non-complying fund\nor scheme) that does not satisfy paragraph (1)(a) or (b) of\nthat section.\n(2) The FWC must ensure that the text of the modern award as\npublished by the FWC does not include a non-complying fund or\nscheme in the relevant term.\n(3) The FWC must do so by 1 January 2014 (despite section 155A of\nthe amended Act).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award:\n(a) is made before 1 January 2014; and\n(b) is in operation on that day; and\n(c) immediately before that day, includes a term (the relevant\nterm) of the kind mentioned in section 155A of the amended\nAct that specifies a fund or scheme (a non-complying fund\nor scheme) that does not satisfy paragraph (1)(a) or (b) of\nthat section.\n(2) The FWC must ensure that the text of the modern award as\npublished by the FWC does not include a non-complying fund or\nscheme in the relevant term.\n(3) The FWC must do so by 1 January 2014 (despite section 155A of\nthe amended Act).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-11-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-11-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-11-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0ee830d1eff4f1e68c4409a44fe6bf440c16cecca2d82861d20e7503baefba72"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 FWC to update text of certain modern awards",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award:\n(a) is made before 1 January 2014; and\n(b) is in operation on that day; and\n(c) immediately before that day, includes a term (the relevant\nterm) of the kind mentioned in section 155A of the amended\nAct that specifies a fund or scheme (a non-complying fund\nor scheme) that does not satisfy paragraph (1)(a) or (b) of\nthat section.\n(2) The FWC must ensure that the text of the modern award as\npublished by the FWC does not include a non-complying fund or\nscheme in the relevant term.\n(3) The FWC must do so by 1 January 2014 (despite section 155A of\nthe amended Act)."
    },
