    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-26-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26(3) Incomplete review of modern award",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-26-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Despite the repeal of paragraph 582(4)(a) (which deals with\ndirections by the President) by the amending Act, a direction given\nby the President to an FWC Member under that paragraph that was\nin force immediately before the Schedule 1 commencement day\ncontinues to have effect, in relation to the review of the modern\naward, as if that repeal had not happened.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Despite the repeal of paragraph 582(4)(a) (which deals with\ndirections by the President) by the amending Act, a direction given\nby the President to an FWC Member under that paragraph that was\nin force immediately before the Schedule 1 commencement day\ncontinues to have effect, in relation to the review of the modern\naward, as if that repeal had not happened.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-26"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-26-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-26-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "03d2063c8c5af6205f70718de4d3087a74c0e6b71b83cf8726f7ad9118dcac72",
      "skos:note": "Continues effect of President's direction despite repeal"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-26-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26(3) Incomplete review of modern award",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Despite the repeal of paragraph 582(4)(a) (which deals with\ndirections by the President) by the amending Act, a direction given\nby the President to an FWC Member under that paragraph that was\nin force immediately before the Schedule 1 commencement day\ncontinues to have effect, in relation to the review of the modern\naward, as if that repeal had not happened.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-26-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
