      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "enterprise agreements and unpaid family and domestic\nviolence leave\n(1) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by an enterprise agreement that was made\nbefore the commencement of the Fair Work Amendment (Family\nand Domestic Violence Leave) Act 2018, the FWC may make a\ndetermination varying the agreement:\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "enterprise agreements and unpaid family and domestic\nviolence leave\n(1) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by an enterprise agreement that was made\nbefore the commencement of the Fair Work Amendment (Family\nand Domestic Violence Leave) Act 2018, the FWC may make a\ndetermination varying the agreement:\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-40-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3315ab08b44a90faf394759fe48c940728c62e82a47c96fd986cde21b276b505",
      "skos:note": "Provides for varying enterprise agreements on application by employer, employee or organisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-40",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40 Resolving uncertainties and difficulties about interaction between",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "enterprise agreements and unpaid family and domestic\nviolence leave\n(1) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by an enterprise agreement that was made\nbefore the commencement of the Fair Work Amendment (Family\nand Domestic Violence Leave) Act 2018, the FWC may make a\ndetermination varying the agreement:\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
    },
