    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-41",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41 Definitions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-41"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\namending Act means the Fair Work Amendment (Improving\nUnpaid Parental Leave for Parents of Stillborn Babies and Other\nMeasures) Act 2020.\nSchedule 1 commencement day means the day on which\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act commences.\nSchedule 2 commencement day means the day on which\nSchedule 2 to the amending Act commences.",
      "skos:definition": "In this Part:\namending Act means the Fair Work Amendment (Improving\nUnpaid Parental Leave for Parents of Stillborn Babies and Other\nMeasures) Act 2020.\nSchedule 1 commencement day means the day on which\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act commences.\nSchedule 2 commencement day means the day on which\nSchedule 2 to the amending Act commences.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-41-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "86836d67ff64e5301fa8baa37343a7613b23f5dcefe0cb8226dbcde01751009c",
      "skos:note": "Defines terms related to Schedule 1 and 2 commencement days."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-41",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41 Definitions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\namending Act means the Fair Work Amendment (Improving\nUnpaid Parental Leave for Parents of Stillborn Babies and Other\nMeasures) Act 2020.\nSchedule 1 commencement day means the day on which\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act commences.\nSchedule 2 commencement day means the day on which\nSchedule 2 to the amending Act commences."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-41-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-41"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-42",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42 Amendments about stillbirth, death and hospitalisation of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-42"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "children\nUnpaid parental leave\n(1) The amendments of Division 5 (parental leave and related\nentitlements) of Part 2-2 made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act\napply in relation to the stillbirth or death of a child on or after the\nSchedule 1 commencement day, subject to subclauses (2) to (4).\n(2) Section 78A (hospitalised children), as inserted by Schedule 1 to\nthe amending Act, applies in relation to a child born on or after the\nSchedule 1 commencement day.\n(3) The amendment of section 84A (replacement employees) made by\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act applies if:\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "children\nUnpaid parental leave\n(1) The amendments of Division 5 (parental leave and related\nentitlements) of Part 2-2 made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act\napply in relation to the stillbirth or death of a child on or after the\nSchedule 1 commencement day, subject to subclauses (2) to (4).\n(2) Section 78A (hospitalised children), as inserted by Schedule 1 to\nthe amending Act, applies in relation to a child born on or after the\nSchedule 1 commencement day.\n(3) The amendment of section 84A (replacement employees) made by\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act applies if:\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-42-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-42-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-42-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "23fa2b51056e7910e0a877e67d93411cbae246af83a53b13be6ee6edf15d3cfb"
    },
