      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendments of Division 5 (parental leave and related\nentitlements) of Part 2-2 made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act\napply in relation to the stillbirth or death of a child on or after the\nSchedule 1 commencement day, subject to subclauses (2) to (4).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The amendments of Division 5 (parental leave and related\nentitlements) of Part 2-2 made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act\napply in relation to the stillbirth or death of a child on or after the\nSchedule 1 commencement day, subject to subclauses (2) to (4).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-42"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
