      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendments of Division 5 (parental leave and related\nentitlements) of Part 2-2 made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act\napply in relation to the stillbirth or death of a child on or after the\nSchedule 1 commencement day, subject to subclauses (2) to (4)."
    },
