      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The amendment of section 84A (replacement employees) made by\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act applies if:\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The amendment of section 84A (replacement employees) made by\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act applies if:\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
