      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The employee cannot take flexible unpaid parental leave before the\nend of 4 weeks starting on the day the notice under subclause (2) is\ngiven, despite subsection 74(4B).\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The employee cannot take flexible unpaid parental leave before the\nend of 4 weeks starting on the day the notice under subclause (2) is\ngiven, despite subsection 74(4B).\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-43"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-43-ss-6-norm"
        },
