      "skos:prefLabel": "45 Resolving uncertainties and difficulties about interaction between",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-45"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "enterprise agreements and the definition of casual\nemployee and casual conversion rights\n(1) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by an enterprise agreement that was made\nbefore commencement, the FWC may make a determination\nvarying the agreement:\n(a) to resolve an uncertainty or difficulty relating to the\ninteraction between the agreement and any of the following:\n(i)  the definition of casual employee in section 15A of the\namended Act (including to deal with uncertainty or\ndifficulty arising from the circumstances in which\nemployees are to be employed as casual employees\nunder the agreement);\n(ii) the provisions of Division 4A of Part 2-2 of the\namended Act; or\n(b) to make the agreement operate effectively with that section or\nthose provisions.\n(2) A variation of an enterprise agreement under this clause operates\nfrom the day specified in the determination, which may be a day\nbefore the determination is made.",
      "skos:definition": "enterprise agreements and the definition of casual\nemployee and casual conversion rights\n(1) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by an enterprise agreement that was made\nbefore commencement, the FWC may make a determination\nvarying the agreement:\n(a) to resolve an uncertainty or difficulty relating to the\ninteraction between the agreement and any of the following:\n(i)  the definition of casual employee in section 15A of the\namended Act (including to deal with uncertainty or\ndifficulty arising from the circumstances in which\nemployees are to be employed as casual employees\nunder the agreement);\n(ii) the provisions of Division 4A of Part 2-2 of the\namended Act; or\n(b) to make the agreement operate effectively with that section or\nthose provisions.\n(2) A variation of an enterprise agreement under this clause operates\nfrom the day specified in the determination, which may be a day\nbefore the determination is made.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-45-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-45-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6d21ed8e0d81514f7f70920ac4c8be451b92af89adc5fed8321b3c448cd3d242"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-45",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45 Resolving uncertainties and difficulties about interaction between",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 39,
      "values:originalText": "enterprise agreements and the definition of casual\nemployee and casual conversion rights\n(1) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by an enterprise agreement that was made\nbefore commencement, the FWC may make a determination\nvarying the agreement:\n(a) to resolve an uncertainty or difficulty relating to the\ninteraction between the agreement and any of the following:\n(i)  the definition of casual employee in section 15A of the\namended Act (including to deal with uncertainty or\ndifficulty arising from the circumstances in which\nemployees are to be employed as casual employees\nunder the agreement);\n(ii) the provisions of Division 4A of Part 2-2 of the\namended Act; or\n(b) to make the agreement operate effectively with that section or\nthose provisions.\n(2) A variation of an enterprise agreement under this clause operates\nfrom the day specified in the determination, which may be a day\nbefore the determination is made."
    },
