      "values:originalText": "(5) A determination under subclause (3) comes into operation on (and\ntakes effect from) the start of the day the determination is made.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A determination under subclause (3) comes into operation on (and\ntakes effect from) the start of the day the determination is made.",
