      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "Non-small business employees\n(1) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply\nin relation to an employee, other than a small business employee,\nwhose employment starts on or after the commencement of that\nSchedule.\n(2) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act also\napply, from the commencement of that Schedule, in relation to an\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "Non-small business employees\n(1) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply\nin relation to an employee, other than a small business employee,\nwhose employment starts on or after the commencement of that\nSchedule.\n(2) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act also\napply, from the commencement of that Schedule, in relation to an\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-52-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-52-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ff9a2ee2aea7409db673a5ce193895c4c613adfe2c6e93d90336ba6886c5edac"
    },
    {
