      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act also\napply, from the commencement of that Schedule, in relation to an\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The amendments made by Schedule 1 to the amending Act also\napply, from the commencement of that Schedule, in relation to an\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "values:partOf": {
