    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-53-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53(2) Resolving interactions between enterprise agreements and paid",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-53-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(2) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by a pre-commencement enterprise\nagreement, the FWC may make a determination varying the\nagreement to make it operate effectively with the following:\n(a) the provisions of Subdivision CA of Division 7 of Part 2-2 as\namended by Schedule 1 to the amending Act;\n(b) section 107, to the extent that it relates to taking leave under\nthat Subdivision.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by a pre-commencement enterprise\nagreement, the FWC may make a determination varying the\nagreement to make it operate effectively with the following:\n(a) the provisions of Subdivision CA of Division 7 of Part 2-2 as\namended by Schedule 1 to the amending Act;\n(b) section 107, to the extent that it relates to taking leave under\nthat Subdivision.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-53"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-53-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-53-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "33b03f2c13eaeaebc654be775dcdd68158e94a1b38305ec075c225fe54b20b18",
      "skos:note": "Employer, employee or organisation may apply for a determination to vary an enterprise agreement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-53-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53(2) Resolving interactions between enterprise agreements and paid",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "(2) On application by an employer, employee or employee\norganisation covered by a pre-commencement enterprise\nagreement, the FWC may make a determination varying the\nagreement to make it operate effectively with the following:\n(a) the provisions of Subdivision CA of Division 7 of Part 2-2 as\namended by Schedule 1 to the amending Act;\n(b) section 107, to the extent that it relates to taking leave under\nthat Subdivision."
    },
