    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-56",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56 Appeal of decisions of the Registered Organisations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-56"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "Commissioner\nDivisions 3 and 4 of Part 5-1, as amended by Division 2 of Part 1\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act, have effect as if a reference to\na decision made under the Registered Organisations Act by the\nGeneral Manager included a reference to a decision made under the\nRegistered Organisations Act before the commencement of\nDivision 2 of Part 1 of that Schedule by the Registered\nOrganisations Commissioner (including a delegate of the\nCommissioner), other than a decision under subsection 293H(3) of\nthe Registered Organisations Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 4 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 3\nClause 57\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "Commissioner\nDivisions 3 and 4 of Part 5-1, as amended by Division 2 of Part 1\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act, have effect as if a reference to\na decision made under the Registered Organisations Act by the\nGeneral Manager included a reference to a decision made under the\nRegistered Organisations Act before the commencement of\nDivision 2 of Part 1 of that Schedule by the Registered\nOrganisations Commissioner (including a delegate of the\nCommissioner), other than a decision under subsection 293H(3) of\nthe Registered Organisations Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 4 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 3\nClause 57\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-56-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "01f73652e62698bfb7ed2577149a288b132bf145d429ea17ae2c66ee1e6d6d28",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner's decisions have effect as if including a reference to a decision made under the Registered Organisations Act before Division 2 of Part 1 of that Schedule."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-56",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56 Appeal of decisions of the Registered Organisations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "Commissioner\nDivisions 3 and 4 of Part 5-1, as amended by Division 2 of Part 1\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act, have effect as if a reference to\na decision made under the Registered Organisations Act by the\nGeneral Manager included a reference to a decision made under the\nRegistered Organisations Act before the commencement of\nDivision 2 of Part 1 of that Schedule by the Registered\nOrganisations Commissioner (including a delegate of the\nCommissioner), other than a decision under subsection 293H(3) of\nthe Registered Organisations Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 4 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 3\nClause 57\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-56-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-56"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-57",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57 Objects of the Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-57"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 3 and 134 of the amended Act apply, after\ncommencement, in relation to the FWC performing functions, or\nexercising powers, in relation to:\n(a) a matter that arises after commencement; or\n(b) a proceeding in the FWC that was on foot at commencement,\nor commences after commencement.\n(2) Section 284 of the amended Act applies, after commencement, in\nrelation to an annual wage review conducted in:\n(a) the financial year beginning on 1 July 2022; or\n(b) a later financial year.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 3 and 134 of the amended Act apply, after\ncommencement, in relation to the FWC performing functions, or\nexercising powers, in relation to:\n(a) a matter that arises after commencement; or\n(b) a proceeding in the FWC that was on foot at commencement,\nor commences after commencement.\n(2) Section 284 of the amended Act applies, after commencement, in\nrelation to an annual wage review conducted in:\n(a) the financial year beginning on 1 July 2022; or\n(b) a later financial year.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-57-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-57-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c2cf1e45ab6ea9605c30dac13e0238f44d6166246bb62ee0f765c5b3a24ef387"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-57",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57 Objects of the Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 3 and 134 of the amended Act apply, after\ncommencement, in relation to the FWC performing functions, or\nexercising powers, in relation to:\n(a) a matter that arises after commencement; or\n(b) a proceeding in the FWC that was on foot at commencement,\nor commences after commencement.\n(2) Section 284 of the amended Act applies, after commencement, in\nrelation to an annual wage review conducted in:\n(a) the financial year beginning on 1 July 2022; or\n(b) a later financial year.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
    },
