      "skos:note": "Section 284 of the amended Act applies to annual wage reviews conducted in specific financial years."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-57-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57(2) Objects of the Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Section 284 of the amended Act applies, after commencement, in\nrelation to an annual wage review conducted in:\n(a) the financial year beginning on 1 July 2022; or\n(b) a later financial year.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
