    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-58-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58(3) Equal remuneration",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If an application under subsection 302(3) of this Act as in force\nimmediately before commencement has not been finally\ndetermined at commencement, subsection 302(5) of the amended\nAct applies in relation to the application as if it were an application\nunder paragraph 302(3)(b) of the amended Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 7 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 5\nClause 59\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026"
    },
    {
