    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-61",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "61 Anti-discrimination and special measures",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-61"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subclauses (2) and (3), the amendments made by Part 9\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply on and after\ncommencement.\n(2) The amendments of sections 172A and 195 made by Part 9 of\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to enterprise\nagreements made on and after commencement.\n(3) The amendment of section 351 made by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the\namending Act applies in relation to adverse action taken on and\nafter commencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 8\nClause 62\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to subclauses (2) and (3), the amendments made by Part 9\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply on and after\ncommencement.\n(2) The amendments of sections 172A and 195 made by Part 9 of\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to enterprise\nagreements made on and after commencement.\n(3) The amendment of section 351 made by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the\namending Act applies in relation to adverse action taken on and\nafter commencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 8\nClause 62\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-61-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-61-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-61-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "99136e5a7d7b11d84556e717a800d404a459437b4e7eae820df9140476f76a6a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-61",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "61 Anti-discrimination and special measures",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subclauses (2) and (3), the amendments made by Part 9\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act apply on and after\ncommencement.\n(2) The amendments of sections 172A and 195 made by Part 9 of\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to enterprise\nagreements made on and after commencement.\n(3) The amendment of section 351 made by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the\namending Act applies in relation to adverse action taken on and\nafter commencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 8\nClause 62\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026"
    },
