      "values:originalText": "(3) The amendment of section 351 made by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the\namending Act applies in relation to adverse action taken on and\nafter commencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 8\nClause 62\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The amendment of section 351 made by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the\namending Act applies in relation to adverse action taken on and\nafter commencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 8\nClause 62\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
