      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "Section 333E of the amended Act applies in relation to a contract\nof employment entered into on or after the commencement of\nPart 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act (whether or not a\nprevious contract referred to in subsection 333E(4) of the amended\nAct was entered into before, on or after that commencement).",
      "skos:definition": "Section 333E of the amended Act applies in relation to a contract\nof employment entered into on or after the commencement of\nPart 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act (whether or not a\nprevious contract referred to in subsection 333E(4) of the amended\nAct was entered into before, on or after that commencement).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-62-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7da7c2ca554623a93c0bc344beb656bbfa6ba7435bd4dad1730cd2f43fcb1a07",
      "skos:note": "Applicability of section 333E to employment contracts entered into after a specific commencement date."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-62",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "62 Fixed term contracts",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "Section 333E of the amended Act applies in relation to a contract\nof employment entered into on or after the commencement of\nPart 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act (whether or not a\nprevious contract referred to in subsection 333E(4) of the amended\nAct was entered into before, on or after that commencement)."
