      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.63",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by Part 16 of Schedule 1 to the amending\nAct apply in relation to enterprise agreements made on and after\nthe commencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by Part 16 of Schedule 1 to the amending\nAct apply in relation to enterprise agreements made on and after\nthe commencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:asserts": [
