    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-72-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "72(7) Industrial action",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-72-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "(7) The amendments of Part 3-3 made by Division 5 of Part 19 of\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to a protected\naction ballot order if the application for the order is made under\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 19 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 15\nClause 72\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026\nsubsection 437(1) of this Act on or after the commencement of that\nDivision.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(7) The amendments of Part 3-3 made by Division 5 of Part 19 of\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to a protected\naction ballot order if the application for the order is made under\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 19 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 15\nClause 72\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026\nsubsection 437(1) of this Act on or after the commencement of that\nDivision.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-72"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-72-ss-7-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f2f740e0a85665b24464621f66ffdeda56f645ca00f77a762be9cbecec7fb915",
      "skos:note": "Application of amendments to protected action ballot order"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-72-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72(7) Industrial action",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(7) The amendments of Part 3-3 made by Division 5 of Part 19 of\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to a protected\naction ballot order if the application for the order is made under\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Secure Jobs, Better Pay)\nAct 2022  Part 13\nAmendments made by Part 19 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 15\nClause 72\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026\nsubsection 437(1) of this Act on or after the commencement of that\nDivision.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
    },
