    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-74",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "74 Application to existing applications for declarations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-74"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies in relation to applications for declarations made\nunder subsection 247(1) of the Act immediately before the\ncommencement of Part 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act if,\nimmediately before that commencement, the Minister had not\nmade a decision on the application.\n(2) Despite the amendments of Division 10 of Part 2-4 made by\nPart 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, that Division continues\nto apply as if those amendments had not been made.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This clause applies in relation to applications for declarations made\nunder subsection 247(1) of the Act immediately before the\ncommencement of Part 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act if,\nimmediately before that commencement, the Minister had not\nmade a decision on the application.\n(2) Despite the amendments of Division 10 of Part 2-4 made by\nPart 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, that Division continues\nto apply as if those amendments had not been made.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-74-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-74-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e22c904438ed6ca888d81f5db3301efac0180a9252aaa4d2a0309089ffd6df81"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-74",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "74 Application to existing applications for declarations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 68,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies in relation to applications for declarations made\nunder subsection 247(1) of the Act immediately before the\ncommencement of Part 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act if,\nimmediately before that commencement, the Minister had not\nmade a decision on the application.\n(2) Despite the amendments of Division 10 of Part 2-4 made by\nPart 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act, that Division continues\nto apply as if those amendments had not been made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-74-ss-1",
