      "skos:definition": "(1) This clause applies in relation to applications for declarations made\nunder subsection 247(1) of the Act immediately before the\ncommencement of Part 21 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act if,\nimmediately before that commencement, the Minister had not\nmade a decision on the application.",
      "values:partOf": {
