    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-83",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "83 Small claims procedure",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-83"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.73",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following provisions apply in relation to small claims\nproceedings commenced on or after the commencement of Part 24\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act:\n(a) the amendment of paragraph 548(2)(a) of this Act made by\nthat Part;\n(b) subsection 548(2A) as inserted by that Part.\n(2) Subsections 548(10) and (11), as inserted by Part 24 of Schedule 1\nto the amending Act, apply in relation to:\n(a) small claims proceedings commenced, but not finally\ndetermined, before the commencement of that Part; and\n(b) small claims proceedings commenced after the\ncommencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The following provisions apply in relation to small claims\nproceedings commenced on or after the commencement of Part 24\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act:\n(a) the amendment of paragraph 548(2)(a) of this Act made by\nthat Part;\n(b) subsection 548(2A) as inserted by that Part.\n(2) Subsections 548(10) and (11), as inserted by Part 24 of Schedule 1\nto the amending Act, apply in relation to:\n(a) small claims proceedings commenced, but not finally\ndetermined, before the commencement of that Part; and\n(b) small claims proceedings commenced after the\ncommencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-83-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-83-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "30756023f77adc68e8f75e9a79c8ca546136266d231efaeeaad150adb08411d4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-83",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "83 Small claims procedure",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 73,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following provisions apply in relation to small claims\nproceedings commenced on or after the commencement of Part 24\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act:\n(a) the amendment of paragraph 548(2)(a) of this Act made by\nthat Part;\n(b) subsection 548(2A) as inserted by that Part.\n(2) Subsections 548(10) and (11), as inserted by Part 24 of Schedule 1\nto the amending Act, apply in relation to:\n(a) small claims proceedings commenced, but not finally\ndetermined, before the commencement of that Part; and\n(b) small claims proceedings commenced after the\ncommencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
    },
