      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.75",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by Part 25B of Schedule 1 to the amending\nAct apply in relation to a request made under subsection 76(1) of\nthis Act on or after the commencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by Part 25B of Schedule 1 to the amending\nAct apply in relation to a request made under subsection 76(1) of\nthis Act on or after the commencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-85-norm"
        }
      ],
