      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\namended Act means this Act as amended by the Fair Work\nLegislation Amendment (Protecting Worker Entitlements) Act\n2023.\namending Act means the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Protecting Worker Entitlements) Act 2023.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Protecting Worker\nEntitlements) Act 2023  Part 14\nAmendments made by Schedule 2 to the amending Act  Division 2\nClause 87\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "In this Part:\namended Act means this Act as amended by the Fair Work\nLegislation Amendment (Protecting Worker Entitlements) Act\n2023.\namending Act means the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Protecting Worker Entitlements) Act 2023.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Protecting Worker\nEntitlements) Act 2023  Part 14\nAmendments made by Schedule 2 to the amending Act  Division 2\nClause 87\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-86-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9dfb947b77721bcc214e8fafe19d7134a7a8a1e75937237404185104e66c48d0",
      "skos:note": "Definitions for amended Act and amending Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-86",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "86 Definitions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\namended Act means this Act as amended by the Fair Work\nLegislation Amendment (Protecting Worker Entitlements) Act\n2023.\namending Act means the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Protecting Worker Entitlements) Act 2023.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Protecting Worker\nEntitlements) Act 2023  Part 14\nAmendments made by Schedule 2 to the amending Act  Division 2\nClause 87\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026"
    },
