    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-87",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "87 Amendments about unpaid parental leave",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-87"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.77",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendments made by Schedule 2 to the amending Act apply\nin relation to an employee in respect of a child if the child’s date of\nbirth, or day of placement, is on or after 1 July 2023.\n(2) If:\n(a) before the commencement of Schedule 2 to the amending\nAct, an employee gave notice to the employee’s employer in\naccordance with subsection 74(1) of the taking of a period of\nunpaid parental leave under section 72 in relation to a child;\nand\n(b) the period of unpaid parental leave is covered by\nparagraph 72(3)(a) or (4)(a); and\n(c) the child’s date of birth, or day of placement, is on or after",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The amendments made by Schedule 2 to the amending Act apply\nin relation to an employee in respect of a child if the child’s date of\nbirth, or day of placement, is on or after 1 July 2023.\n(2) If:\n(a) before the commencement of Schedule 2 to the amending\nAct, an employee gave notice to the employee’s employer in\naccordance with subsection 74(1) of the taking of a period of\nunpaid parental leave under section 72 in relation to a child;\nand\n(b) the period of unpaid parental leave is covered by\nparagraph 72(3)(a) or (4)(a); and\n(c) the child’s date of birth, or day of placement, is on or after",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-87-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-87-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "04c4a22443a2596ed81215f058529a703c52179a9c9fd597107986868c2f7439"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-87",
