    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-89",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "89 Interaction of a workplace determination with an earlier",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-89"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "enterprise agreement\nThe amendments made by Schedule 4 to the amending Act apply\nin relation to:\n(a) an enterprise agreement that applies to an employee in\nrelation to particular employment before, on or after the\ncommencement of that Schedule; and\n(b) a workplace determination that:\n(i) covers the employee in relation to the same\nemployment; and\n(ii) comes into operation before, on or after the\ncommencement of that Schedule.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Protecting Worker\nEntitlements) Act 2023  Part 14\nAmendments made by Schedule 5 to the amending Act  Division 5\nClause 90\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "enterprise agreement\nThe amendments made by Schedule 4 to the amending Act apply\nin relation to:\n(a) an enterprise agreement that applies to an employee in\nrelation to particular employment before, on or after the\ncommencement of that Schedule; and\n(b) a workplace determination that:\n(i) covers the employee in relation to the same\nemployment; and\n(ii) comes into operation before, on or after the\ncommencement of that Schedule.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Protecting Worker\nEntitlements) Act 2023  Part 14\nAmendments made by Schedule 5 to the amending Act  Division 5\nClause 90\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-89-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-89-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c5a1e18dcd9417727c8fa9bf69598df1f3c1ab20614260521d783c88f71ed898",
      "skos:note": "Interaction of a workplace determination with an earlier enterprise agreement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-89",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "89 Interaction of a workplace determination with an earlier",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "enterprise agreement\nThe amendments made by Schedule 4 to the amending Act apply\nin relation to:\n(a) an enterprise agreement that applies to an employee in\nrelation to particular employment before, on or after the\ncommencement of that Schedule; and\n(b) a workplace determination that:\n(i) covers the employee in relation to the same\nemployment; and\n(ii) comes into operation before, on or after the\ncommencement of that Schedule.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Protecting Worker\nEntitlements) Act 2023  Part 14\nAmendments made by Schedule 5 to the amending Act  Division 5\nClause 90\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026"
    },
    {
