      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.95",
      "values:originalText": "Subsection 245(2), as inserted by the amending Act, applies in\nrelation to enterprise agreements and workplace determinations\nthat come into operation before or after the commencement of\nPart 4 of Schedule 1 to that Act.",
      "skos:definition": "Subsection 245(2), as inserted by the amending Act, applies in\nrelation to enterprise agreements and workplace determinations\nthat come into operation before or after the commencement of\nPart 4 of Schedule 1 to that Act.",
