      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "(6) A variation operates from the day specified by the FWC in the\nvariation, which must not be a day before the variation is made.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A variation operates from the day specified by the FWC in the\nvariation, which must not be a day before the variation is made.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "values:partOf": {
