      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "111(6) Application of amendments to intractable bargaining workplace",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "(6) A variation operates from the day specified by the FWC in the\nvariation, which must not be a day before the variation is made.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
