    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "111B Application of section 149F of the amended Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-111b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.100",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 149F (right to disconnect term) of the amended Act applies\nin relation to a modern award that is in operation on or after\ncommencement, whether or not the award was made before\ncommencement.\n(2) However, a modern award is not invalid on or after\ncommencement only because it does not include a right to\ndisconnect term.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Section 149F (right to disconnect term) of the amended Act applies\nin relation to a modern award that is in operation on or after\ncommencement, whether or not the award was made before\ncommencement.\n(2) However, a modern award is not invalid on or after\ncommencement only because it does not include a right to\ndisconnect term.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111b-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "67d6d513db088352cae088ee1bf1556d69c7e20b57ba00496e291f27a3d3ce82"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-111b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "111B Application of section 149F of the amended Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 100,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Section 149F (right to disconnect term) of the amended Act applies\nin relation to a modern award that is in operation on or after\ncommencement, whether or not the award was made before\ncommencement.\n(2) However, a modern award is not invalid on or after\ncommencement only because it does not include a right to\ndisconnect term."
    },
