    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-111c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "111C FWC to vary certain modern awards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-111c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.100",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award:\n(a) is made before commencement; and\n(b) is to be in operation on commencement.\n(2) The FWC must, by the day before commencement, make a\ndetermination varying the modern award to include a right to\ndisconnect term.\n(3) A determination made under subclause (2) comes into operation on\n(and takes effect from) commencement.\n(4) Section 168 applies to a determination made under subclause (2) as\nif it were a determination made under Part 2-3.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nMain amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes\nNo. 2) Act 2024  Part 16\nAmendments made by Part 8 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 5A\nClause 111D\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a modern award if the award:\n(a) is made before commencement; and\n(b) is to be in operation on commencement.\n(2) The FWC must, by the day before commencement, make a\ndetermination varying the modern award to include a right to\ndisconnect term.\n(3) A determination made under subclause (2) comes into operation on\n(and takes effect from) commencement.\n(4) Section 168 applies to a determination made under subclause (2) as\nif it were a determination made under Part 2-3.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nMain amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes\nNo. 2) Act 2024  Part 16\nAmendments made by Part 8 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 5A\nClause 111D\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
