      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "Section 357, as amended by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the amending\nAct, applies in relation to representations made on or after the\ncommencement of that Part.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nMain amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes\nNo. 2) Act 2024  Part 16\nAmendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 7\nClause 113\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "Section 357, as amended by Part 9 of Schedule 1 to the amending\nAct, applies in relation to representations made on or after the\ncommencement of that Part.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nMain amendments made by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes\nNo. 2) Act 2024  Part 16\nAmendments made by Part 10 of Schedule 1 to the amending Act  Division 7\nClause 113\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
