      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.103",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of subsection 510(1) made by Part 10 of\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to each entry\npermit held by a permit holder whether issued before, on or after\nthe commencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of subsection 510(1) made by Part 10 of\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act apply in relation to each entry\npermit held by a permit holder whether issued before, on or after\nthe commencement of that Part.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
