      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of section 557, conduct engaged in before that\ncommencement cannot constitute the same course of conduct as\nconduct engaged in after that commencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by Part 15 of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 17\nDefinitions  Division 1\nClause 115\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026"
    },
