    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-118-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "118(2) Entitlements determined by reference to length of a period of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-118-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of determining whether the individual has a right\nor entitlement under the amended Act or under a fair work\ninstrument in respect of the employment of the individual, being a\nright or entitlement calculated by reference to:\n(a) the individual’s length of service (however described) as an\nemployee; or\n(b) a minimum period of employment (however described) of the\nindividual;\nthe nature of the relationship between the individual and the person\nin respect of a period or periods before commencement is to be\nascertained in accordance with the old Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of determining whether the individual has a right\nor entitlement under the amended Act or under a fair work\ninstrument in respect of the employment of the individual, being a\nright or entitlement calculated by reference to:\n(a) the individual’s length of service (however described) as an\nemployee; or\n(b) a minimum period of employment (however described) of the\nindividual;\nthe nature of the relationship between the individual and the person\nin respect of a period or periods before commencement is to be\nascertained in accordance with the old Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-118"
      },
