    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-119",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "119 Old Act applies to proceedings on foot as at commencement",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-119"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite the amendment made by item 237 of Part 15 of Schedule 1\nto the amending Act, the old Act continues to apply, on and after\ncommencement, as if that amendment had not been made, in\nrelation to the following:\n(a) an application made, or proceedings on foot, as at\ncommencement, other than an application or proceedings\nprescribed by the regulations;\n(b) an application for review of, or an appeal relating to, an\napplication or proceedings referred to in paragraph (a)\n(whether the application for review was made, or the appeal\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Despite the amendment made by item 237 of Part 15 of Schedule 1\nto the amending Act, the old Act continues to apply, on and after\ncommencement, as if that amendment had not been made, in\nrelation to the following:\n(a) an application made, or proceedings on foot, as at\ncommencement, other than an application or proceedings\nprescribed by the regulations;\n(b) an application for review of, or an appeal relating to, an\napplication or proceedings referred to in paragraph (a)\n(whether the application for review was made, or the appeal\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-119-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "799439e0d9ce6c83f33bcec4fda7d81a372bf0e32b1df0cd6bf3729ab770a37e",
      "skos:note": "Old Act applies on and after commencement, despite amendment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-119",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "119 Old Act applies to proceedings on foot as at commencement",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 107,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite the amendment made by item 237 of Part 15 of Schedule 1\nto the amending Act, the old Act continues to apply, on and after\ncommencement, as if that amendment had not been made, in\nrelation to the following:\n(a) an application made, or proceedings on foot, as at\ncommencement, other than an application or proceedings\nprescribed by the regulations;\n(b) an application for review of, or an appeal relating to, an\napplication or proceedings referred to in paragraph (a)\n(whether the application for review was made, or the appeal\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-119-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
