    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "120(2) FWC power to deal with uncertainties or difficulties arising",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-120-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The FWC may make a determination under subclause (1) varying a\nmodern award:\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n(b) on application by an employer, employee, organisation or\noutworker entity covered by the modern award; or\n(c) on application by an organisation that is entitled to represent\nthe industrial interests of one or more employers or\nemployees covered by the modern award; or\n(d) if the modern award includes outworker terms—on\napplication by an organisation that is entitled to represent the\nindustrial interests of one or more outworkers to whom the\noutworker terms relate.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The FWC may make a determination under subclause (1) varying a\nmodern award:\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n(b) on application by an employer, employee, organisation or\noutworker entity covered by the modern award; or\n(c) on application by an organisation that is entitled to represent\nthe industrial interests of one or more employers or\nemployees covered by the modern award; or\n(d) if the modern award includes outworker terms—on\napplication by an organisation that is entitled to represent the\nindustrial interests of one or more outworkers to whom the\noutworker terms relate.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "45a27741ce7470b069630dafd6505d69828e26454ebf2380dc10e92be16562a5",
      "skos:note": "FWC may vary modern award on its own initiative or application by employer, employee, organisation, or outworker entity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-120-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "120(2) FWC power to deal with uncertainties or difficulties arising",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 108,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The FWC may make a determination under subclause (1) varying a\nmodern award:\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n(b) on application by an employer, employee, organisation or\noutworker entity covered by the modern award; or\n(c) on application by an organisation that is entitled to represent\nthe industrial interests of one or more employers or\nemployees covered by the modern award; or\n(d) if the modern award includes outworker terms—on\napplication by an organisation that is entitled to represent the\nindustrial interests of one or more outworkers to whom the\noutworker terms relate."
    },
