    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "120(4) FWC power to deal with uncertainties or difficulties arising",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-120-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The FWC may make a determination under subclause (1) varying\nan FWC order:\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n(b) on application:\n(i) by a person affected by the order; or\n(ii) if the FWC order is of a kind prescribed by the\nregulations—by a person prescribed by the regulations\nin relation to that kind of order.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The FWC may make a determination under subclause (1) varying\nan FWC order:\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n(b) on application:\n(i) by a person affected by the order; or\n(ii) if the FWC order is of a kind prescribed by the\nregulations—by a person prescribed by the regulations\nin relation to that kind of order.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-120-ss-4-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "aff1a30dd0e083c516ebf69302fd08e1799091161bdd84a0b47b4e6c8430b9a3",
      "skos:note": "FWC may vary FWC orders under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-120-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "120(4) FWC power to deal with uncertainties or difficulties arising",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 108,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The FWC may make a determination under subclause (1) varying\nan FWC order:\n(a) on its own initiative; or\n(b) on application:\n(i) by a person affected by the order; or\n(ii) if the FWC order is of a kind prescribed by the\nregulations—by a person prescribed by the regulations\nin relation to that kind of order."
    },
