      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.112",
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\namended Act means this Act as amended by the Fair Work\nLegislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024.\namending Act means the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024.\ncommencement means the commencement of item 238 of Part 16\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act.\nold Act means this Act as in force immediately before\ncommencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by Part 16 of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 18\nTransitional provisions  Division 2\nClause 124\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "In this Part:\namended Act means this Act as amended by the Fair Work\nLegislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024.\namending Act means the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024.\ncommencement means the commencement of item 238 of Part 16\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act.\nold Act means this Act as in force immediately before\ncommencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by Part 16 of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 18\nTransitional provisions  Division 2\nClause 124\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-1-sec-123-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fbc6b787af1d800d3b4daaadfa05af0ff99d2039bd24ef983a71fe027ca3e3a2",
      "skos:note": "Definitions for amended Act and commencement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-1-sec-123",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "123 Definitions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 112,
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\namended Act means this Act as amended by the Fair Work\nLegislation Amendment (Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024.\namending Act means the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024.\ncommencement means the commencement of item 238 of Part 16\nof Schedule 1 to the amending Act.\nold Act means this Act as in force immediately before\ncommencement.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of this Act\nSchedule 1\nAmendments made by Part 16 of Schedule 1 to the Fair Work Legislation Amendment\n(Closing Loopholes No. 2) Act 2024  Part 18\nTransitional provisions  Division 2\nClause 124\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026"
    },
