      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.113",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Despite the amendments of the Independent Contractors Act 2006\nmade by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing\nLoopholes No. 2) Act 2024, the Independent Contractors Act 2006\ncontinues to apply to the services contract after commencement as\nif those amendments had not been made.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Despite the amendments of the Independent Contractors Act 2006\nmade by the Fair Work Legislation Amendment (Closing\nLoopholes No. 2) Act 2024, the Independent Contractors Act 2006\ncontinues to apply to the services contract after commencement as\nif those amendments had not been made.\n\nSchedule 1  Application, saving and transitional provisions relating to amendments of\nthis Act",
      "values:partOf": {
