      "cml:premiseText": "(1) Section 149B, subsection 149C(1) and section 149D apply in relation to a modern award that:\n(a) is made on or after 1 January 2014; or\n(b) is made before 1 January 2014 and that is varied on or after\nthat day under Division 4A of Part 2-3 (as inserted by\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act).",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(a) Section 149B, subsection 149C(1) and section 149D apply in relation to a modern award that:\n(a) is made on or after 1 January 2014; or\n(b) is made before 1 January 2014 and that is varied on or after\nthat day under Division 4A of Part 2-3 (as inserted by\nSchedule 1 to the amending Act)."
