      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Despite the repeal of sections 149A and 155A made by Schedule 1\nto the amending Act, those sections continue in force in relation to\na modern award that:\n(a) is made before 1 January 2014; and\n(b) is not varied on or after that day under Division 4A of",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Despite the repeal of sections 149A and 155A made by Schedule 1\nto the amending Act, those sections continue in force in relation to\na modern award that:\n(a) is made before 1 January 2014; and\n(b) is not varied on or after that day under Division 4A of",
