    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2A Transitional provision—when first variations of default fund",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-2a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "term take effect\n(1) This clause applies to the first 4 yearly review of default fund\nterms of modern awards under Division 4A of Part 2-3 (as inserted\nby Schedule 1 to the amending Act).\n(2) In the review, determinations under that Division (whether made\nunder section 156H or 156J) varying the default fund term of a\nmodern award:\n(a) must take effect at the same time; and\n(b) must not take effect before 1 January 2015.\n\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3\nDefault superannuation (Schedule 1)  Part 2\n\nClause 2B\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "term take effect\n(1) This clause applies to the first 4 yearly review of default fund\nterms of modern awards under Division 4A of Part 2-3 (as inserted\nby Schedule 1 to the amending Act).\n(2) In the review, determinations under that Division (whether made\nunder section 156H or 156J) varying the default fund term of a\nmodern award:\n(a) must take effect at the same time; and\n(b) must not take effect before 1 January 2015.\n\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3\nDefault superannuation (Schedule 1)  Part 2\n\nClause 2B\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
