      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.121",
      "values:originalText": "If a modern award is made in the period that starts on 1 January\n2014 and ends on 31 December 2017, then, until the default fund\nterm of the award is varied after that period under Division 4A of",
      "skos:definition": "If a modern award is made in the period that starts on 1 January\n2014 and ends on 31 December 2017, then, until the default fund\nterm of the award is varied after that period under Division 4A of",
