      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by Part 2 of Schedule 4 to the amending\nAct (which is about bargaining representatives) apply in relation to\nappointments of bargaining representatives that are made after the\ncommencement of that Part.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by Part 2 of Schedule 4 to the amending\nAct (which is about bargaining representatives) apply in relation to\nappointments of bargaining representatives that are made after the\ncommencement of that Part.",
      "cml:asserts": [
