      "skos:note": "Amendments apply after commencement of Part 2 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Part 2 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act",
