    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Part 3 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The amendment made by Part 3 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act\n(which is about unlawful terms) applies in relation to enterprise\nagreements that are made before or after the commencement of that\nPart.\n(2) However, if:\n(a) an enterprise agreement that was made before the\ncommencement of that Part included a term referred to in\nparagraph 194(ba) (as inserted by Part 3 of Schedule 4 to the\namending Act); and\n(b) a person made an election in accordance with that term\nbefore the commencement of that Part;\nthen the amendment does not apply in relation to that person.\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The amendment made by Part 3 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act\n(which is about unlawful terms) applies in relation to enterprise\nagreements that are made before or after the commencement of that\nPart.\n(2) However, if:\n(a) an enterprise agreement that was made before the\ncommencement of that Part included a term referred to in\nparagraph 194(ba) (as inserted by Part 3 of Schedule 4 to the\namending Act); and\n(b) a person made an election in accordance with that term\nbefore the commencement of that Part;\nthen the amendment does not apply in relation to that person.\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-6-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-6-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e7e2460e809d78faff0ae44fd7895490781e8ed0e5ca4cab5b8fa4df624cb681"
    },
    {
