      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.124",
      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by Part 4 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act\n(which is about scope orders) applies in relation to applications for\na scope order that are made after the commencement of that Part.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by Part 4 of Schedule 4 to the amending Act\n(which is about scope orders) applies in relation to applications for\na scope order that are made after the commencement of that Part.",
      "cml:asserts": [
