      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.130",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A determination made under subclause (4) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\n\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3\nChanging the name of Fair Work Australia (Schedule 9)  Part 9\n\nClause 25\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A determination made under subclause (4) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\n\nAmendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2012  Schedule 3\nChanging the name of Fair Work Australia (Schedule 9)  Part 9\n\nClause 25\nFair Work Act 2009\nCompilation date: 02/04/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-24"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
