    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-25-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "25(5) Transitional provision—Deputy President",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-25-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.131",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (3):\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in\nrelation to, a Deputy President of FWA; or\n(b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy\nPresident of the FWC were a reference to the FWC; or\n(c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy\nPresident of the FWC were a reference to another FWC\nmember.\nA determination under this subclause has effect accordingly.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (3):\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in\nrelation to, a Deputy President of FWA; or\n(b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy\nPresident of the FWC were a reference to the FWC; or\n(c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the Deputy\nPresident of the FWC were a reference to another FWC\nmember.\nA determination under this subclause has effect accordingly.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-25"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
