      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.132",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, before that commencement, a thing was done by, or in relation\nto, a Commissioner of FWA, then, for the purposes of the\noperation of any law on or after that commencement, the thing is\ntaken to have been done by, or in relation to, a Commissioner of\nthe FWC.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If, before that commencement, a thing was done by, or in relation\nto, a Commissioner of FWA, then, for the purposes of the\noperation of any law on or after that commencement, the thing is\ntaken to have been done by, or in relation to, a Commissioner of\nthe FWC.",
