    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-27-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "27(2) Transitional provision—Minimum Wage Panel Member",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 133,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If, before that commencement, a thing was done by, or in relation\nto, a Minimum Wage Panel Member of FWA, then, for the\npurposes of the operation of any law on or after that\ncommencement, the thing is taken to have been done by, or in\nrelation to, a Minimum Wage Panel Member of the FWC."
