      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 134,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If, before the commencement of Part 1 of Schedule 9 to the\namending Act, a thing was done by, or in relation to, FWA, then,\nfor the purposes of the operation of any law on or after that\ncommencement, the thing is taken to have been done by, or in\nrelation to, the FWC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-28-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
