    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-28-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "28(3) Operation of laws—things done by, or in relation to, FWA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-28-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.134",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (1):\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in\nrelation to, FWA; or\n(b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the FWC were\na reference to the President of the FWC; or\n(c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the FWC were\na reference to another FWC member.\nA determination under this subclause has effect accordingly.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (1):\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in\nrelation to, FWA; or\n(b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the FWC were\na reference to the President of the FWC; or\n(c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the FWC were\na reference to another FWC member.\nA determination under this subclause has effect accordingly.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-28"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-28-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ab8eb8d5acc613a2b3afff693b569ed2b247c5765baea9477978abac025a57f9",
      "skos:note": "Determination of subclause application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-28-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "28(3) Operation of laws—things done by, or in relation to, FWA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 134,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (1):\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in\nrelation to, FWA; or\n(b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the FWC were\na reference to the President of the FWC; or\n(c) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the FWC were\na reference to another FWC member.\nA determination under this subclause has effect accordingly."
    },
