    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29(3) Transitional provision—General Manager and staff of FWA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-29-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.134",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of subclause (2), a thing done before that\ncommencement under a provision amended by Part 1, 2 or 3 of\nSchedule 9 to the amending Act has effect from that\ncommencement as if it were done under that provision as amended.\nHowever, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing\nwas actually done.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of subclause (2), a thing done before that\ncommencement under a provision amended by Part 1, 2 or 3 of\nSchedule 9 to the amending Act has effect from that\ncommencement as if it were done under that provision as amended.\nHowever, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing\nwas actually done.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c6ea614a9bab14330c8c32258bfe05eba2c0d8d9b39b74e66918b4a0d0d31755",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement provision"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-29-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29(3) Transitional provision—General Manager and staff of FWA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 134,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of subclause (2), a thing done before that\ncommencement under a provision amended by Part 1, 2 or 3 of\nSchedule 9 to the amending Act has effect from that\ncommencement as if it were done under that provision as amended.\nHowever, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing\nwas actually done."
    },
