    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29(4) Transitional provision—General Manager and staff of FWA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-29-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.134",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (2):\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in\nrelation to, the General Manager of FWA; or\n(b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the General\nManager of the FWC were a reference to the\nCommonwealth.\nA determination under this subclause has effect accordingly.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (2):\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in\nrelation to, the General Manager of FWA; or\n(b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the General\nManager of the FWC were a reference to the\nCommonwealth.\nA determination under this subclause has effect accordingly.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-29-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "98ee6d803ac356240a7214dceb7d5d952b68e1b7fe1354f22bfd2453662ec924",
      "skos:note": "Determination by Minister regarding subclause (2)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-29-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29(4) Transitional provision—General Manager and staff of FWA",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 134,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister may, by writing, determine that subclause (2):\n(a) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in\nrelation to, the General Manager of FWA; or\n(b) applies as if the reference in that subclause to the General\nManager of the FWC were a reference to the\nCommonwealth.\nA determination under this subclause has effect accordingly."
    },
