      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-32",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32 Regulations about application, transitional and saving matters",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-32"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.137",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The regulations may prescribe matters of an application,\ntransitional or saving nature relating to the amendments and\nrepeals made by the amending Act.\n(2) Without limiting subclause (1), the regulations may:\n(a) provide that Part 9 of this Schedule or Part 4 of Schedule 9 to\nthe amending Act applies with specified modifications; or\n(b) provide that the Transitional Act applies with specified\nmodifications.\n(3) The provisions referred to in subclause (2) have effect subject to\nregulations made for the purposes of this clause.\n(4) Subsection 12(2) (retrospective application of legislative\ninstruments) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not apply to:\n(a) regulations relating to the amendments and repeals made by\nSchedule 9 to the amending Act; and\n(b) regulations made for the purposes of subclause (2).\n\nSchedule 4  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The regulations may prescribe matters of an application,\ntransitional or saving nature relating to the amendments and\nrepeals made by the amending Act.\n(2) Without limiting subclause (1), the regulations may:\n(a) provide that Part 9 of this Schedule or Part 4 of Schedule 9 to\nthe amending Act applies with specified modifications; or\n(b) provide that the Transitional Act applies with specified\nmodifications.\n(3) The provisions referred to in subclause (2) have effect subject to\nregulations made for the purposes of this clause.\n(4) Subsection 12(2) (retrospective application of legislative\ninstruments) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not apply to:\n(a) regulations relating to the amendments and repeals made by\nSchedule 9 to the amending Act; and\n(b) regulations made for the purposes of subclause (2).\n\nSchedule 4  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-32-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-32-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-32-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:fair-work-act-2009-sch-3-sec-32-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "22da9e78a65923d7ba83e44b9eb73a8fb083289c0d045d1b57d51eb00170d84b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/fair-work-act-2009#sch-3-sec-32",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32 Regulations about application, transitional and saving matters",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 137,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The regulations may prescribe matters of an application,\ntransitional or saving nature relating to the amendments and\nrepeals made by the amending Act.\n(2) Without limiting subclause (1), the regulations may:\n(a) provide that Part 9 of this Schedule or Part 4 of Schedule 9 to\nthe amending Act applies with specified modifications; or\n(b) provide that the Transitional Act applies with specified\nmodifications.\n(3) The provisions referred to in subclause (2) have effect subject to\nregulations made for the purposes of this clause.\n(4) Subsection 12(2) (retrospective application of legislative\ninstruments) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not apply to:\n(a) regulations relating to the amendments and repeals made by\nSchedule 9 to the amending Act; and\n(b) regulations made for the purposes of subclause (2).\n\nSchedule 4  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013"
    },
