      "dc:source": "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.145",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The amendments made by Part 2 of Schedule 4A to the amending\nAct apply in relation to employment that is terminated after the\ncommencement of that Schedule.\n\nSchedule 4  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The amendments made by Part 2 of Schedule 4A to the amending\nAct apply in relation to employment that is terminated after the\ncommencement of that Schedule.\n\nSchedule 4  Amendments made by the Fair Work Amendment Act 2013",
